      "writtenOn": "2026-10-21T17:10:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The service account is not a DMTF role. Its RoleId is OemIBMServiceAgent (also published as Oem.IBM.ServiceAgent or ServiceAgent). That account is in priv-admin, so the fallback privileges are the Administrator set: Login, ConfigureManager, ConfigureUsers, ConfigureComponents, and ConfigureSelf.\n\nFirmware update is UpdateService POST, which requires ConfigureComponents, so this account is allowed. ReadOnly is not. OEM privileges published by the BMC are included as well, and the Administrator set is always kept for these role names so a Role resource that omits ConfigureComponents does not block the Firmware page.",
      "parentUuid": "e95853b0_e012a735",
      "revId": "6f21cfb8c99931c6c0769f1c5ca57dd3636952f1",
